# Blood Hustler's ruling: "If the target opponent is an illegal target as Blood Hustler's activated ability tries to
# resolve, it won't resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won't gain life." Bot1 activates it at Bot2 (a
# crime: the counter trigger goes on the stack above it); Bot2 answers with Dawn's Truce, gaining hexproof. The counter
# trigger resolves (the crime was committed), and the drain does not (CR 608.2b): both stay at 20.

